{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07438","headline":"和樊使君登润州城楼 · 刘长卿","name":"和樊使君登润州城楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山城迢遰敞高楼，露冕吹铙居上头。\n春草连天随北望，夕阳浮水共东流。\n江田漠漠全吴地，野树苍苍故蒋州。\n王粲尚爲南郡客，别来何处更销忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}